            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"140\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.1)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">PAIN = PERCEIVED THREAT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Real pain can happen with no injury</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">The brain acts on the evidence it has</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"420\" width=\"800\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"475\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"20\">Seeing a nail through a boot = danger</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Context can outvote tissue reality</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Why did the unharmed builder hurt so much?"
